   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "PLACEMENT\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 2, CC 17 to 32\n   1 Object\n   2 Object path\n   3 Object speed\n   4 Object in frame\n   5 Number of people\n   6 Where they stand\n   7 Eyelines\n   8 Who is sharp\n   9 Look of the actor\n  10 Empty frame\n  11 Foreshortening\n  12 suite: Power staging\n  13 suite: Alone in the frame\n  14 suite: Dinner table scene\n  15 suite: Glamour close-up\n  16 suite: Hushed two-hander\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 2, CC 33 to 47\n   1 suite: Car chase\n   2 pair: When an object enters, the frame becomes an insert\n   3 pair: When people get closer, they hold each other's look\n   4 pair: When something looms at the lens, the audience flinches\n   5 pair: When a door is in the shot, someone comes through it\n   6 pair: When the focus moves to a door, someone is about to come in\n   7 pair: When food is on the table, people talk with their mouths full\n   8 pair: When an object moves fast, it smears into a blur\n   9 pair: When an object drops, a sound hit lands with it\n  10 pair: When an actor's look is striking, the camera holds on them longer\n  11 pair: When more people fill the scene, the sound gets busy\n  12 pair: When more people are in the scene, it needs more angles\n  13 pairs: Closing in\n  14 pairs: Dinner gets messy\n  15 pairs: Speed and impact"
   },
